@reportingUrl = http://localhost:5142
@restaurantId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### Dashboard diario consolidado para todos los locales
GET {{reportingUrl}}/api/reporting/dashboard/daily

### Dashboard diario de un local
GET {{reportingUrl}}/api/reporting/dashboard/daily?restaurantId={{restaurantId}}

### Salud de endpoints monitorizados
GET {{reportingUrl}}/api/reporting/health
